<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<div class="legal-content">
	<section>
		<h2>1. An overview of data protection</h2>
		<h3>General information</h3>
		<p>The following information will provide you with a easy to navigate overview of what will happen with your personal data when you visit this website.</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>2. Local Storage & AI Features</h2>
		<p>This blog uses modern browser features, including <strong>Built-in AI APIs</strong> and <strong>Local Storage</strong>.</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Admin State</strong>: We use local storage to remember if you have enabled admin features for editing content.</li>
			<li><strong>AI Context</strong>: Some features might process content locally in your browser using Gemini Nano. This data never leaves your device and is not sent to our servers.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>3. Hosting</h2>
		<p>We host our website with Netlify/Vercel. User data collected on this website is stored on the hoster's servers.</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>4. Your Rights</h2>
		<p>You have the right to receive information about the source, recipient, and purposes of your archived personal data at any time without a fee. You also have the right to demand that your data are rectified or eradicated.</p>
	</section>
</div>
